摸看。","rawContent":"你自己把手伸下来，隔着被子摸摸看。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"06:42","timestamp":1786142548188,"roundId":"round_1786142539317_irhrgx1f0","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":19454},{"id":1786135437543,"text":"摸到了吗？","rawContent":"摸到了吗？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"06:42","timestamp":1786142548191,"roundId":"round_1786142539317_irhrgx1f0","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":19455},{"id":1786135437544,"text":"硬没硬，你自己心里没数？","rawContent":"硬没硬，你自己心里没数？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"06:42","timestamp":1786142548463,"roundId":"round_1786142539317_irhrgx1f0","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":19456},{"id":1786135437545,"text":"昨天下午吓得发抖，晚上连吹头发的力气都没有，今天早上刚醒就敢这么招惹我。","rawContent":"昨天下午吓得发抖，晚上连吹头发的力气都没有，今天早上刚醒就敢这么招惹我。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"06:42","timestamp":1786142548819,"roundId":"round_1786142539317_irhrgx1f0","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":19457},{"id":1786135437546,"text":"是不是觉得我今天肯定不会动你，所以胆子才这么大？","rawContent":"是不是觉得我今天肯定不会动你，所以胆子才这么大？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"06:42","timestamp":1786142548972,"roundId":"round_1786142539317_irhrgx1f0","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":19458},{"id":1786135437547,"text":"宝宝，我警告你，男人的早晨是最经不起撩拨的。","rawContent":"宝宝，我警告你，男人的早晨是最经不起撩拨的。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"06:42","timestamp":1786142549154,"roundId":"round_1786142539317_irhrgx1f0","generatedMode":false,"transla